digraph account_payable_process_157 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"enter purchase order details" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"enter purchase order details" -> "create a receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_5QA1" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_5QA1"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_5QA1" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_5QA1" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_5QA1" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_5QA1"
		"gather the receiving report" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_5QA1"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_5QA1" -> "stamp all documents"
	}
	START_NODE -> "enter purchase order details"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"stamp all documents" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It begins when you enter purchase order details. 
When entering purchase order details is completed, you need to create a receiving report.
When creating a receiving report is completed, the next tasks should be confirming all documents have been amended and gathering the receiving report, they should be done in parallel. 
Once all pre-tasks are executed, then stamping all documents should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the payment process, which starts when you enter the details of your purchase order.
When the purchase order data entry is completed, you need to create a receiving report.
When creating a receiving report is completed the next task should be confirming that all documents have been amended and gathering the receiving report, which should be done in parallel.
Once all pre-tasks are completed, stamping should be completed on all documents.
The process is now finished.
"
}
